      "content": "Okay, I see. So for the debate, they'll need to be able to present these arguments with some level of gravity to be convincing. Can you elaborate on the \"social degeneration\" argument? Specifically, how did they link the idea of racial mixing or integration to the actual decline of civilization or the \"purity\" of the nation? Like, what were the specific fears or supposed societal consequences they warned about? The kids need to understand the actual logic they were using to justify these laws as a \"necessity\" for society.",
