      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The \"social degeneration\" argument warned that racial mixing would lead to the erosion of American civilization and social order, which they often equated with the perceived superiority of the white culture. They feared that interracial interaction would dilute the supposed inherent virtues of the \"Nordic\" or white race, leading to societal decay and a breakdown of established social norms. By framing segregation as a defense mechanism, they presented adherence to racial separation not as prejudice, but as a necessary prophylactic measure to preserve national integrity and cultural purity.",
